# The tests that stand in front of a read in the turn (the kind of the storage, whether the element is there) are longer than the read that asks for itself. They pay where they make a turn quiet. In a loop whose turn calls a function that nobody knows no turn is quiet: the typed copy there is bought for other things, and the read asks for itself as it does outside of typed copies. The rule goes by the call, not by looks: the file's name is of the first form of the rule.
